+
+  /* Coverage build only (this patch is not applied to the fuzzing build):
+  _exit() does not run atexit handlers or static destructors, so libgcov never
+  writes this process' counters. Exim handles every SMTP session in a forked
+  child (daemon.c "if (pid == 0)") that leaves through this function after
+  smtp_start_session()/receive_msg()/deliver_message(), so without an explicit
